WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.870
GALARC KINGDOM, TRADE CITY AMANDE

00:02.870 --> 00:03.980
GALARC KINGDOM, TRADE CITY AMANDE
Tomorrow,

00:04.330 --> 00:07.030
I'll send my attendant
your way in the morning.

00:07.450 --> 00:09.280
Thank you for taking me this far.

00:09.280 --> 00:10.990
I appreciate it.

00:14.810 --> 00:17.620
I'll show you around the inn, Master Haruto.

00:17.620 --> 00:19.370
Please do.

00:39.020 --> 00:41.560
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

01:42.110 --> 01:45.080
I could just sue you for rude behaviour.

01:45.080 --> 01:46.460
You little!

01:48.330 --> 01:50.090
You!

01:52.300 --> 01:56.260
THE INTRUDERS

01:56.690 --> 01:57.750
Haruto!

01:58.470 --> 02:00.650
Thanks for waiting, Cecilia.

02:01.020 --> 02:03.860
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

02:03.860 --> 02:06.980
I'm not hurt, so please rest easy.

02:07.600 --> 02:10.710
And we seem to have gathered
the attention here...

02:11.690 --> 02:12.450
Hm?

02:15.990 --> 02:20.260
So, Miss Liselotte provided me with an inn.

02:20.630 --> 02:24.470
We'll be staying in Amande
for a few days.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.630
Okay.

02:25.930 --> 02:28.840
I'm sorry for asking for permission
right after I did it.

02:28.840 --> 02:32.310
I'm fine with it, but Aria...

02:32.850 --> 02:36.230
Your impression has changed now,

02:36.230 --> 02:37.710
so I think it'll be fine.

02:38.370 --> 02:39.530
Anyway...

02:40.570 --> 02:44.750
I was on my way with a royal from Beltrum...

02:44.750 --> 02:46.230
Huh? Who?

02:46.230 --> 02:50.000
The second princess, Princess Flora,
Duke Huguenot,

02:50.000 --> 02:53.460
and also Miss Roanna from
the Duke Fontaine house.

02:53.460 --> 02:55.200
Now that's some big shots.

02:55.740 --> 03:00.350
Princess Flora and Roanna
should know about you, right?

03:00.350 --> 03:02.080
Did they notice you?

03:02.080 --> 03:06.750
Princess Flora seemed to have good sense,
so she sort of noticed my aura.

03:07.460 --> 03:11.180
But I changed my hair colour,
so I'll be fine.

03:11.180 --> 03:15.610
Hey, shouldn't we leave Amande?

03:15.610 --> 03:18.330
Well, there are some risks.

03:18.330 --> 03:22.310
But I want to forge a good relationship
with Miss Liselotte.

03:22.310 --> 03:24.230
With her?

03:24.230 --> 03:29.110
If the hero of Galarc is
the one I'm looking for,

03:29.110 --> 03:33.520
It's good to forge good relationships with
the powerful people in the kingdom.

03:34.010 --> 03:37.360
Okay, but don't let your guard down.

03:37.690 --> 03:41.410
Miss Liselotte is a capable
and famous person.

03:41.410 --> 03:42.120
Okay.

03:42.480 --> 03:45.620
Just let me know if I can help you.

03:46.060 --> 03:47.760
Thank you.

03:48.250 --> 03:49.830
Then let me ask you something...

03:49.830 --> 03:50.620
What is it?

03:50.960 --> 03:55.140
Actually, I'm meeting her tomorrow.

03:55.140 --> 04:01.070
If possible, could you teach me
the manners in a noble's manor?

04:01.070 --> 04:02.350
Leave it to me!

04:03.440 --> 04:08.520
Still, that attendant of yours...
Aria, wasn't it?

04:08.520 --> 04:11.680
Her work was truly remarkable.

04:11.680 --> 04:13.520
Thank you.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.400
But...

04:14.860 --> 04:19.410
Shouldn't the Hero possess
the power to overturn that situation?

04:19.870 --> 04:21.140
Perhaps.

04:21.530 --> 04:24.720
But, nevertheless,
he lacks actual battle experience.

04:25.850 --> 04:30.370
But his power to lift that minotaur sword...

04:30.880 --> 04:34.220
Does that come from his
letting out his divine power?

04:34.960 --> 04:36.710
That must be the case.

04:37.110 --> 04:41.470
If he's not compatible, he won't be able
to let out his power, like a curse sword.

04:41.470 --> 04:45.640
But if it's his divine equipment, then the only one
compatible would be the Hero, or so I heard.

04:46.100 --> 04:49.380
He could let out such power
without training...

04:49.380 --> 04:50.980
What a mystery.

04:51.730 --> 04:55.750
So he really lacks actual battle experience?

04:55.750 --> 04:59.910
We also don't want to put
our precious hero in harm's way.

05:00.270 --> 05:03.980
It's too early to throw him right into battle.

05:03.980 --> 05:06.620
Hence, we decided on mock-up battles
with the knights.

05:06.620 --> 05:10.980
His first battle turned out
to be something heavy.

05:10.980 --> 05:15.900
Just think of it as him
obtaining the needed experience.

05:16.740 --> 05:20.110
I guess the Duke considers the Hero...

05:20.110 --> 05:23.750
...as nothing more than
a symbol of authority for now.

05:24.790 --> 05:26.570
In the end...

05:26.570 --> 05:30.430
Had he not arrived,
we would've been all done for.

05:30.910 --> 05:32.990
Master Haruto...

05:34.350 --> 05:38.030
He took down three minotaurs in a flash.

05:38.030 --> 05:41.810
He couldn't have done that
without full control of the curse sword.

05:42.540 --> 05:45.170
The identity of such a magic swordsman...

05:45.170 --> 05:47.390
What do you think, Liselotte?

05:48.240 --> 05:50.380
His swordsmanship is excellent,

05:50.380 --> 05:54.330
but his way of speaking and behaving
also evoked a sense of nobility.

05:54.330 --> 05:59.230
He might be hiding his identity,
and he might be from a fallen noble family.

06:01.940 --> 06:08.100
I'd like to know him better
to build our future relationship...

06:08.540 --> 06:11.390
Would you like to join me
in meeting him tomorrow?

06:11.950 --> 06:14.100
Thank goodness you're
so quick to catch on.

06:14.540 --> 06:16.170
Understood.

06:16.170 --> 06:20.450
In exchange, you can use my knights.

06:20.450 --> 06:22.800
Your personal knights, my Duke?

06:23.710 --> 06:27.350
You're investigating
why the demons appeared, right?

06:27.950 --> 06:31.700
It can never hurt to have
more people in the forest.

06:31.700 --> 06:33.410
That'll be helpful.

06:33.790 --> 06:36.920
More unusual happenings
just keep on appearing.

06:37.270 --> 06:40.900
Yes. Just a while ago,
a lot of adventures went missing.

06:40.900 --> 06:43.790
We temporarily had more reports coming in.

06:44.930 --> 06:46.960
It's this way, right?

06:46.960 --> 06:47.840
Yeah.

06:47.840 --> 06:51.970
Are you really taking us to that restaurant?

06:51.970 --> 06:55.250
It's famous for its tall prices, you know?

06:55.250 --> 06:57.710
No need to worry about money.

06:57.710 --> 07:00.460
We've been there before.

07:00.890 --> 07:04.200
Who do you think we are?

07:04.200 --> 07:06.540
My nobles!

07:08.510 --> 07:11.830
My, I'm feeling good, Stewart.

07:11.830 --> 07:14.380
Indeed, Sir Alphonse.

07:14.380 --> 07:16.710
It makes up for what happened today.

07:16.710 --> 07:19.530
Don't talk about that!

07:19.530 --> 07:24.460
Geez, that Haruto guy
just came out of nowhere...

07:24.460 --> 07:25.920
Who is he?

07:25.920 --> 07:29.010
Never mind him, the hero...

07:29.010 --> 07:31.970
You know, in the battle earlier...

07:32.390 --> 07:34.330
You got scared and hid behind, right?

07:34.330 --> 07:36.350
You really lost your nerves back there, eh?

07:36.700 --> 07:40.980
Get a grip, my dear knights.

07:41.500 --> 07:43.990
Who actually lost their nerve?!

07:43.990 --> 07:47.200
How dare he treat us like newbies!

07:47.200 --> 07:49.530
Don't talk about him again!

07:49.530 --> 07:51.050
Let's have another drink!

07:52.990 --> 07:54.460
We can't use it?

07:54.460 --> 07:56.570
The room where we can see the garden?

07:56.570 --> 08:01.190
We already have other guests in the room...

08:01.540 --> 08:04.160
We can get you another room...

08:04.160 --> 08:07.900
You can just tell them
to exchange rooms.

08:07.900 --> 08:10.000
I'll pay three times the price.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.550
We're really sorry.

08:13.260 --> 08:18.300
She once slept in the bathroom, you know!

08:18.300 --> 08:20.820
I was surprised
when I was about to take a bath.

08:20.820 --> 08:23.190
It's so warm and soothing.

08:23.190 --> 08:25.570
Let's sleep in bed.

08:25.570 --> 08:27.350
Out of the way!

08:27.350 --> 08:28.990
You can't do that, Sir!

08:29.820 --> 08:32.100
We can't talk with you.

08:32.100 --> 08:34.430
I won't be responsible
for what happens next.

08:34.430 --> 08:35.550
I don't mind.

08:35.980 --> 08:36.830
A fight?

08:37.220 --> 08:39.530
What a stubborn guy.

08:39.530 --> 08:41.500
That's enough, Stewart.

08:41.500 --> 08:44.020
I'll talk to the guests inside myself.

08:44.020 --> 08:45.760
Please wait!

08:46.420 --> 08:48.930
I'm really sorry about this, Sir.

08:48.930 --> 08:50.630
Could you care to explain?

08:50.630 --> 08:52.600
Hm? You...

08:53.030 --> 08:55.100
Are you Haruto?

08:55.450 --> 08:59.350
I'm sorry, but who are you?

08:59.350 --> 09:03.830
My apologies.
I am Stewart Huguenot.

09:03.830 --> 09:06.060
He is Alphonse Rodan.

09:06.060 --> 09:09.990
We belong to the knight group
that you saved today.

09:12.140 --> 09:13.620
Stewart...

09:14.090 --> 09:15.260
Alphonse...

09:16.330 --> 09:20.170
Is that so? Excuse me.

09:20.530 --> 09:22.430
So, what might your business be?

09:22.850 --> 09:25.670
We'd like to use this room.

09:26.950 --> 09:28.270
All right.

09:28.710 --> 09:31.180
We were just about done eating.

09:31.510 --> 09:33.030
Feel free to use this.

09:35.500 --> 09:36.890
You two, come here.

09:38.020 --> 09:40.850
Hang in there.

09:40.850 --> 09:41.770
Can I help you?

09:41.770 --> 09:46.250
You there, want to eat with us now?

09:46.250 --> 09:50.410
Unfortunately, we have already
eaten and drunk enough.

09:50.410 --> 09:53.710
Oh, you're rejecting our offer?

09:53.710 --> 09:55.590
We're still tired from our journey too.

09:55.590 --> 09:57.440
That's not good.

09:57.440 --> 09:59.430
You might be skilled with your sword,

09:59.430 --> 10:01.790
but you're just a pleb, right?

10:01.790 --> 10:03.460
Please, spare us.

10:03.460 --> 10:06.960
Sir Alphonse, you should just...

10:06.960 --> 10:11.170
Sir, if you keep bothering other guests,

10:11.170 --> 10:13.840
we will have to take measures...

10:13.840 --> 10:14.850
Excuse us, then.

10:14.850 --> 10:15.690
Wait.

10:15.690 --> 10:17.850
Sir Alphonse?

10:18.330 --> 10:19.600
What do you want?

10:19.600 --> 10:23.170
Seems like you don't know
how to talk with nobles.

10:23.660 --> 10:26.110
Unfortunately, I was born into a normal family.

10:26.750 --> 10:29.700
I could just sue you
for rude behaviour.

10:30.030 --> 10:36.030
I hear rudeness is strictly limited
by national law and territorial decrees.

10:36.810 --> 10:40.190
Did I do something rude to you...

10:40.190 --> 10:42.350
...that warrant the violation of such law?

10:43.290 --> 10:47.420
How dare you, lowly pleb!

10:48.180 --> 10:50.670
You...

10:51.470 --> 10:52.840
Sir Alphonse!

10:52.840 --> 10:54.270
Let go of him!

10:54.270 --> 10:57.280
If I let go, he'll just punch me soon enough.

10:57.280 --> 10:58.350
That's enough!

11:00.560 --> 11:03.100
You're not getting away with this!

11:07.360 --> 11:09.150
You!

11:11.150 --> 11:15.740
I guess we can't settle this in peace.

11:16.530 --> 11:21.340
Could you find someone who can
take care of these men properly?

11:21.340 --> 11:23.040
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

11:24.090 --> 11:26.540
That's the whole incident.

11:26.970 --> 11:29.540
The tenant's testimony also matches.

11:30.090 --> 11:31.670
Okay.

11:32.020 --> 11:33.730
Just the worst...

11:33.730 --> 11:36.910
I don't want people to know them
as arrogant nobles...

11:36.910 --> 11:40.930
With this incident,
it'll make them wary of us!

11:41.280 --> 11:43.430
Those insolent fools...

11:43.430 --> 11:45.140
Where's Master Haruto?

11:45.140 --> 11:47.910
He's already resting in the inn.

11:47.910 --> 11:51.210
Then, I'll apologise to him next morning.

11:51.210 --> 11:54.460
Understood.
I'll make the preparations.

11:54.830 --> 11:58.320
I must ensure my son's
foolishness is dealt with.

11:58.910 --> 12:03.540
Could you tell him I am sorry,
and that I put good faith in him?

12:03.990 --> 12:05.550
Understood.

12:10.990 --> 12:12.500
You two fools.

12:14.570 --> 12:17.630
I wasn't expecting much from you,

12:17.630 --> 12:20.890
but I'm really disappointed in you now.

12:21.260 --> 12:23.140
I thought I told you before.

12:23.610 --> 12:25.710
There won't be next time.

12:26.930 --> 12:30.950
Rejoice, for I will disinherit you
of my wealth, as you wish.

12:30.950 --> 12:32.800
Disinherit?!

12:32.800 --> 12:38.350
Isn't that just too much,
just because I fought a plebeian knight?

12:38.350 --> 12:39.910
Just a plebeian?

12:40.230 --> 12:42.720
He seems more capable than you, though?

12:43.690 --> 12:46.450
I guess you're just too incapable.

12:46.810 --> 12:48.970
Incapable?

12:49.440 --> 12:54.670
Even if it's you, I still want you
to take back those words!

12:55.270 --> 12:59.050
He's a swordsman
who took down three minotaurs.

12:59.050 --> 13:02.010
So you're saying you can do
the same thing?

13:02.010 --> 13:05.230
If I have a curse sword...

13:05.230 --> 13:10.340
I heard you ganged up on him,
but he did you good instead.

13:11.690 --> 13:15.710
Then I'll give you a chance
to redeem yourself.

13:16.170 --> 13:20.160
At this point, you won't even
have any face to show your father.

13:20.160 --> 13:23.030
I'll do it! Please let me!

13:23.030 --> 13:28.160
Liselotte is investigating
the forest west of Amande.

13:28.160 --> 13:30.830
You want me to help her...

13:30.830 --> 13:34.570
If you could show results as a frontliner,

13:34.570 --> 13:38.650
I'll putting in a good word for you in this.

13:39.730 --> 13:42.120
Of course, if you couldn't,

13:42.120 --> 13:44.900
I'll have you be put
on house arrest in Rodania.

13:44.900 --> 13:46.890
Please let me do it!

13:46.890 --> 13:48.330
Very well.

13:48.330 --> 13:49.350
However...

13:49.730 --> 13:53.080
You must first apologise to Haruto.

13:54.230 --> 13:55.130
Am I understood?

13:55.130 --> 13:58.150
Yes...

14:00.810 --> 14:02.880
I'm sorry about yesterday.

14:03.340 --> 14:07.750
You had to witness something mentally
draining because you stuck with me.

14:08.200 --> 14:12.070
I'm still feeling a bit nervous now, though.

14:12.070 --> 14:13.710
Then, from today...

14:13.710 --> 14:17.760
Why don't you live with
Aishia in the rock house?

14:17.760 --> 14:20.960
No way! I'm good!

14:20.960 --> 14:24.360
But aren't you getting enough rest?

14:24.360 --> 14:28.020
It's okay. I don't want to
leave your side...

14:29.790 --> 14:31.930
I mean, I'm worried!

14:31.930 --> 14:34.240
I'm worried about you, that's all!

14:34.240 --> 14:36.860
Sure, thank you.

14:37.310 --> 14:39.590
You can run away when you have to.

14:40.340 --> 14:42.320
R-Right!

14:47.910 --> 14:49.550
Wait here.

14:49.550 --> 14:50.270
Understood.

14:52.630 --> 14:54.270
I'm Cecilia.

14:54.270 --> 14:55.540
I'm Aishia.

14:55.920 --> 15:00.980
Nice to meet you.
You two look so pretty.

15:00.980 --> 15:02.670
Thank you.

15:03.130 --> 15:06.480
Please wait in the room inside.

15:06.480 --> 15:07.600
Okay.

15:08.210 --> 15:09.550
Excuse us.

15:11.530 --> 15:16.000
Duke Huguenot would like to apologise.

15:16.000 --> 15:17.260
I see.

15:17.690 --> 15:21.940
If you have any requests,
feel free to say it.

15:22.510 --> 15:27.910
Then, could you please write a letter
to ensure that this commotion...

15:27.910 --> 15:29.710
...is properly resolved?

15:30.150 --> 15:31.610
Understood.

15:32.000 --> 15:35.630
I'll act as a mediator
and help with the writing.

15:36.030 --> 15:37.410
Thank you.

15:37.830 --> 15:40.480
So, if it's okay with you,

15:40.480 --> 15:43.500
we'd still like to invite you
to our manor as promised.

15:43.500 --> 15:45.300
Would you care for some lunch?

15:45.750 --> 15:47.830
Feel free to take your friends as well.

15:48.260 --> 15:50.010
I'm sorry.

15:50.010 --> 15:53.530
They're still tired from last night.

15:53.530 --> 15:55.820
So I'll come there alone.

15:57.820 --> 16:01.260
Anyway, how about that?

16:01.260 --> 16:04.740
I think it's leaning a bit too much on me...

16:05.360 --> 16:08.410
If you're okay with this, then...

16:08.780 --> 16:10.570
Of course I am.

16:10.570 --> 16:14.350
As for the official contract...

16:14.350 --> 16:18.390
Can I leave it
to the third party Liselotte in making it?

16:18.850 --> 16:20.330
Understood.

16:20.330 --> 16:21.340
All right.

16:21.660 --> 16:25.940
I'd like to take responsibility
as the parent for this crime.

16:27.320 --> 16:28.340
If you like,

16:28.340 --> 16:32.190
would you give the perpetrators
a chance to say sorry?

16:32.570 --> 16:34.740
Sure, go ahead.

16:35.190 --> 16:36.230
Thank you.

16:36.710 --> 16:37.860
Come in.

16:41.620 --> 16:44.690
Now, thank him for his kind heart.

16:44.690 --> 16:47.150
Be sure to say sorry to him.

16:47.990 --> 16:50.660
We're truly sorry!

16:53.890 --> 16:56.180
Please stand up.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.990
Master Haruto!

17:01.380 --> 17:04.770
It's an honour to meet you again, Princess Flora.

17:04.770 --> 17:06.130
Well, take a seat.

17:06.510 --> 17:08.190
I heard you had it rough.

17:08.190 --> 17:10.380
Excuse me.

17:11.110 --> 17:15.770
Liselotte's cook is really the best.

17:15.770 --> 17:17.220
Thank you.

17:17.540 --> 17:21.210
Still, with good meat,
I could use some rice.

17:21.210 --> 17:24.890
Actually, we tried making that rice...

17:24.890 --> 17:26.560
Really?

17:26.930 --> 17:31.530
It's just a bit different
from the one in your world.

17:31.530 --> 17:35.310
If we cook it as it is,
it won't be so good.

17:36.320 --> 17:39.920
So we tried to improvise.

17:41.700 --> 17:42.580
Wow...

17:43.220 --> 17:44.460
Let's see...

17:44.460 --> 17:45.980
This is...

17:48.490 --> 17:51.050
This is good!
Cheese risotto, eh!

17:51.510 --> 17:53.070
Thank you.

17:53.070 --> 17:56.700
So you know the food of this world?

17:57.310 --> 18:00.990
Yeah, it's the name of the food
in my world similar to this.

18:00.990 --> 18:02.600
Then, while we're at it,

18:03.030 --> 18:05.880
I'll just name this risotto.

18:05.880 --> 18:07.360
Sure, I don't mind.

18:07.820 --> 18:09.370
This is delicious.

18:09.370 --> 18:11.740
It's so thick with cheese...

18:13.070 --> 18:15.120
This isn't bad.

18:15.640 --> 18:18.960
Just like the pasta developed in Ricca Guild...

18:19.730 --> 18:23.870
So she actually possesses
knowledge of earth?

18:24.930 --> 18:27.590
Master Haruto, how do you like it?

18:28.010 --> 18:30.100
It's wonderful.

18:30.100 --> 18:33.410
I never thought
I'd be able to eat rice.

18:33.800 --> 18:37.030
Since when have you been travelling?

18:37.030 --> 18:39.030
Since I was eleven.

18:39.030 --> 18:41.990
Oh, right.
How old are you?

18:41.990 --> 18:43.750
I'm sixteen.

18:44.390 --> 18:47.020
You've been travelling
since you were a kid?

18:47.550 --> 18:51.180
Well, I guess you can do
anything with your parents.

18:51.180 --> 18:54.860
My parents passed away
just before I started travelling.

18:55.360 --> 18:57.140
So I mostly travel alone.

18:57.140 --> 19:00.340
I see. Sorry for asking.

19:00.340 --> 19:02.700
Not at all.

19:03.030 --> 19:09.040
Um, why did you start travelling alone?

19:09.040 --> 19:13.770
It must be because I wanted to
find those close with my parents.

19:14.590 --> 19:17.730
Are you not planning on
settling down somewhere?

19:18.100 --> 19:20.480
I'm still on my journey.

19:22.070 --> 19:24.190
Then, as a candidate,

19:24.190 --> 19:27.810
you can think of Beltrum to settle down.

19:27.810 --> 19:31.690
With your skills,
I'll hire you for a big price.

19:31.690 --> 19:36.240
Oh, then allow me to vouch for you.

19:36.560 --> 19:39.970
That'll be lovely.
If I have the chance...

19:39.970 --> 19:45.120
Look at you, getting cheered on.
Are we witnessing a new hero?

19:45.120 --> 19:47.810
Not at all.

19:47.810 --> 19:51.970
I'm no match for the real hero
like you, Master Hiroaki.

19:51.970 --> 19:55.310
Well, no matter how hard you do,

19:55.310 --> 19:59.640
only the real hero has the level
and power to take down everything.

20:00.140 --> 20:05.430
If you get that,
I think you can go for a good spot.

20:05.430 --> 20:06.830
Thank you.

20:07.210 --> 20:12.170
By the way, Galarc also
has a hero descending...

20:12.170 --> 20:14.170
Or so I heard.

20:14.170 --> 20:18.660
With that extravagant pillar,
I guess there's no hiding it.

20:18.660 --> 20:22.390
You're about to announce her officially
at the night party, right?

20:22.740 --> 20:25.090
The Galarc's female hero.

20:26.140 --> 20:28.290
Is she a woman?

20:28.290 --> 20:31.290
Yes. She's Satsuki Sumeragi.

20:31.710 --> 20:34.490
The hero that has been
summoned to our kingdom.

20:35.680 --> 20:38.550
Sumeragi? Satsuki?

20:38.550 --> 20:41.600
They are Satsuki and Takahisa,
but they disappeared first.

20:41.600 --> 20:43.810
- Are they in this world too?
- There's no mistaking it.

20:44.340 --> 20:46.640
She's the one Miharu's looking for.

20:47.340 --> 20:51.690
Master Hiroaki, you will
also be put to display there.

20:51.690 --> 20:54.250
Beltrum's Hero...

20:54.250 --> 20:57.570
We also invited Rui Shigekura.

20:57.570 --> 21:00.700
It's kind of annoying to be
put together with a fake.

21:01.170 --> 21:04.450
Well, this is just a hero's duty, right?

21:04.890 --> 21:07.660
This is turning extravagant.

21:08.010 --> 21:09.390
There's another one.

21:09.390 --> 21:13.070
A hero from Centostella joining the party...

21:13.070 --> 21:16.090
Or so the rumours say.

21:16.090 --> 21:17.960
I see.

21:18.460 --> 21:20.140
I'm finally moving forward.

21:20.510 --> 21:22.160
This is a huge step.

21:23.230 --> 21:26.170
Now I have great news for them.

21:34.190 --> 21:36.690
Damn! Why me?!

21:37.090 --> 21:39.410
Why do I have to do this
for such a pleb's sake?!

21:39.820 --> 21:42.410
I'm not incapable!

21:42.410 --> 21:46.580
Just you see, Duke!

21:46.930 --> 21:48.570
Don't let your guard down!

21:48.570 --> 21:51.490
Who knows when a minotaur might show up.

21:52.330 --> 21:54.660
That won't be necessary.

21:58.210 --> 22:01.360
There are no longer demons in this forest.

22:02.340 --> 22:03.250
Who goes there?!

23:40.070 --> 23:41.040
